## Third-party acknowledgment

This software (the browser UI, the FastAPI bridge server, and the `.docx`
rendering pipeline in `frontend/` and `server/`) is original work covered by
the license above.

At runtime, it depends on a separate, unmodified project it does not include:
**[ai-job-search](https://github.com/MadsLorentzen/ai-job-search)** by
**Mads Lorentzen**, itself MIT licensed. That project supplies the actual
job-fit scoring, gap-analysis, resume-tailoring, and cover-letter logic this
app calls into via the Claude Agent SDK — none of that logic is reimplemented
or duplicated here. It is intentionally **not bundled** in this repository:
see `.gitignore` and `GITHUB-UPLOAD-GUIDE.md` for why. Anyone running this
software needs their own local copy of that project (or a compatible fork) to
use the AI-powered features; its own MIT license and copyright notice govern
that copy, independently of this one.
